                  <provenance><orgName role="fmo" key="org_337">London. Franciscan convent</orgName><p>Apparently borrowed by Charles d'Orléans: his inventory A.D.
                        1436, no. 104: De Laborde, Les Ducs de Bourgogne, 3. 330 (no. 6550). This
